Origin
------
The simulator is the owner's own project, https://github.com/qunabu/Gravity (originally GPL-3.0),
relicensed by its copyright holder under MIT for use inside ulams (2026-10-09, issue #147, ADR 0088).
Imported from the working tree of that repository, after commit 28e912b, which also holds the
unreleased "stopped-galaxy" step.

Left out on purpose
-------------------
- Commits bc9d770 and 9db0edc by David Frankel (Docker files; ulams ships its own deployment).
- Commit 4adaa1b by jin (the Chinese translation of the tour).
- The background-music track and the Moon photograph (Moon-TomBrown.webp): neither has a stated
  licence. The Moon uses a procedurally generated surface instead.

